OL,3,ATrump, Putin and Xi plan historic joint
OL,4,Ameeting in China next week, White House
OL,5,Asays
OL,6,
OL,7,F"The president has made it clear that,
OL,8,Famong other topics, he will discuss the
OL,9,Freduction of nuclear weapons in the
OL,10,Fworld, whose proliferation President
OL,11,FTrump believes is very dangerous," she
OL,12,Fsaid.
OL,14,FIt is understood Iran may also be
OL,15,Fdiscussed during the meeting of the
OL,16,Fworld's biggest nuclear powers, but not
OL,17,FUkraine. Moscow and Beijing are yet to
OL,18,Fcomment.
